Installing ndmanager
====================

ndmanager is built and installed with the rest of NeuroSuite from the top of
the repository; see doc/INSTALL.md (and doc/BUILD.md for build options):

    cmake -B build -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX="$HOME/.local" -DNS_INSTALL_DEPS=ON
    cmake --build build --parallel
    cmake --install build

To install ndmanager alone, turn the other programs off at configure time
(doc/INSTALL.md, "Installing one program only").

Building this directory on its own (cmake -S src/ndmanager) needs an
installed LibKlustersShared 2.1.0 or newer, found through CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH
or the install prefix.
